Package: bulkiRNA
Title: Bulk RNA-seq Differential Expression and Gene-Set Analysis
Version: 1.2.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Anton", "Zhelonkin", email = "antonz@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A compact toolkit for bulk RNA-seq differential expression and
    gene-set analysis. Gene-set databases are provided by a pluggable gsdb_*
    provider layer; testing and scoring go through gs_test() and gs_score()
    (fgsea, over-representation, and GSVA); results are carried in normalized
    gs_result / gs_matrix objects that the gs_plot_* renderers consume. Compute
    functions never plot and renderers never compute.
